# Omnivorous Flytrap, "distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures": chosen together with the targets (CR 601.2d),
# one each to the Flytrap and to Bot2's Llanowar Elves (a creature an opponent controls is a legal target). The graveyard holds five card
# types - instant (Lightning Bolt, cast), sorcery (Faithless Looting), artifact and creature (the discarded Ornithopter) and land (the
# discarded Plains) - which is four or more but not six, so nothing doubles: the Elves is a 2/2 and the Flytrap a 3/5, one counter each.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby x2
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Ornithopter
Omnivorous Flytrap
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Plains x18

